display_name = "Jack Pot"
role = "Lobs spring-loaded jack-in-the-box mines, up to three out at once (one more pops the oldest). Each one lands, winds up its tune and arms: the first zombie within 2.5 m sets it off, and a clown on a spring pops out with a boxing-glove punch that knocks it into the air, stuns it and hits everything around it. A box that hits a zombie in flight pops at once. Heavies only hop and bosses are only nudged. Seed a choke point, then switch guns; aim down sights to see where it lands."
